# needs menu-drag.scm: a title opens its menu as it is pressed (d1); the
# button dragged to Delta highlights it (d2) and released there chooses it
# ("SUB delta" in the log) and closes the menu (d3). A click on a title
# leaves its menu open (d4); the submenu of More (d5) closes when the
# pointer rests on the disabled item (d6), on the rule (d7) and on the
# group title (d8), each time after it was opened again (d6b, d7b); a
# press on the title of the open menu closes it (d9).
# A drag from the first title over the second opens the second menu (d10),
# and the release on Epsilon chooses it ("SUB epsilon").
wait 6000
window Menu drag
resize 400 300
wait 800
press 30 16
wait 600
snapshot d1
move 50 60
wait 100
move 60 149
wait 300
snapshot d2
release 60 149
wait 500
snapshot d3
click 30 16
wait 500
snapshot d4
move 60 69
wait 700
snapshot d5
move 60 99
wait 700
snapshot d6
move 60 69
wait 700
snapshot d6b
move 60 85
wait 700
snapshot d7
move 60 69
wait 700
snapshot d7b
move 60 124
wait 700
snapshot d8
press 30 16
wait 100
release 30 16
wait 500
snapshot d9
press 30 16
wait 300
move 60 16
move 95 16
wait 500
snapshot d10
move 110 44
wait 300
release 110 44
wait 500
snapshot d11
